#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:163
msgid "History of rounds"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:164
msgid "Keep the ticks and values of the closed rounds of repeating checklists, visible only with the ID that edits. Off: only a summary of the last round is kept. Switching it off deletes every kept round."
msgstr ""

